(7474901, 1187636, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another great capture - the participants in this challenge so far are really all on the same page - great candids.</td>', 'Another great capture - the participants in this challenge so far are really all on the same page - great candids.', '2016-09-21 09:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474902, 1187161, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is going on here other than panhandling. But its a great capture.</td>', 'Not sure what is going on here other than panhandling. But its a great capture.', '2016-09-21 09:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474903, 1187629, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image - different certainly.</td>', 'Very interesting image - different certainly.', '2016-09-21 09:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474904, 1187601, 101256, '<td valign="top">I think it might have worked better from in front looking down the hill, but the intent and execution is fine.</td>', 'I think it might have worked better from in front looking down the hill, but the intent and execution is fine.', '2016-09-21 09:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474906, 1187585, 101256, '<td valign="top">Love it in particular the mirror trick. Great composition - well done.</td>', 'Love it in particular the mirror trick. Great composition - well done.', '2016-09-21 09:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474907, 1187578, 101256, '<td valign="top">Like the color changes. Image shows passion and joy - very nice candid.</td>', 'Like the color changes. Image shows passion and joy - very nice candid.', '2016-09-21 09:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474908, 1187499, 101256, '<td valign="top">Can''t complain about this image - another great capture.</td>', 'Can''t complain about this image - another great capture.', '2016-09-21 09:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474910, 1187650, 101256, '<td valign="top">The concentration on the faces of the subjects is perfect - one trying to stay perfectly stiff and the other trying to perfect a face paint. Well done.</td>', 'The concentration on the faces of the subjects is perfect - one trying to stay perfectly stiff and the other trying to perfect a face paint. Well done.', '2016-09-21 09:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474911, 1187575, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this, but the color is way over done and the image could use more contrast.</td>', 'I like this, but the color is way over done and the image could use more contrast.', '2016-09-21 09:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474912, 1187313, 101256, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better if the image wasn''t posed.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better if the image wasn''t posed.', '2016-09-21 09:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474914, 1187405, 101256, '<td valign="top">Can''t knock images of Mom''s - all Mom''s work no matter what it is. Nice candid.</td>', 'Can''t knock images of Mom''s - all Mom''s work no matter what it is. Nice candid.', '2016-09-21 09:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474915, 1187285, 101256, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture - excellent color - a great entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Terrific capture - excellent color - a great entry into the challenge.', '2016-09-21 09:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474916, 1187427, 101256, '<td valign="top">Lots to look at, but the subject gets a little lost in the jumble of angles and other objects.</td>', 'Lots to look at, but the subject gets a little lost in the jumble of angles and other objects.', '2016-09-21 09:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474917, 1187589, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wow - incredible capture and post processing. Excellent.</td>', 'Wow - incredible capture and post processing. Excellent.', '2016-09-21 09:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474918, 1187528, 101256, '<td valign="top">Love it - could have used a little more cropping, but overall effect is positive.</td>', 'Love it - could have used a little more cropping, but overall effect is positive.', '2016-09-21 09:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474941, 1187134, 101256, '<td valign="top">Great view of something unusual - hauling the docking line to the bollard. Nice capture.</td>', 'Great view of something unusual - hauling the docking line to the bollard. Nice capture.', '2016-09-21 11:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474942, 1187616, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image - very impressive detail and color.</td>', 'Wonderful image - very impressive detail and color.', '2016-09-21 11:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474943, 1187104, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing a fair of some sort - heritage celebration with vendors?  Who cares - great capture.</td>', 'I''m guessing a fair of some sort - heritage celebration with vendors?  Who cares - great capture.', '2016-09-21 11:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474944, 1187342, 101256, '<td valign="top">Some really outside the box composition and editing on this one. Great detail, the very slight touch of sepia - wow, can''t say enough about this - excellent.</td>', 'Some really outside the box composition and editing on this one. Great detail, the very slight touch of sepia - wow, can''t say enough about this - excellent.', '2016-09-21 11:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474945, 1187594, 101256, '<td valign="top">Cog railway - unique capture for sure.</td>', 'Cog railway - unique capture for sure.', '2016-09-21 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474946, 1186976, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very good - took me a minute to compare the title to the image then I saw it. Intriguing.</td>', 'Very good - took me a minute to compare the title to the image then I saw it. Intriguing.', '2016-09-21 11:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474947, 1187309, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not often you see a motion capture this precise. Would have preferred to see a little closer look at the Blackhawk, but still a great image.</td>', 'Not often you see a motion capture this precise. Would have preferred to see a little closer look at the Blackhawk, but still a great image.', '2016-09-21 11:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474948, 1187603, 101256, '<td valign="top">Richly detailed capturing the essence of a sometimes boring, sometimes exciting job. Great candid.</td>', 'Richly detailed capturing the essence of a sometimes boring, sometimes exciting job. Great candid.', '2016-09-21 11:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474949, 1187137, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail,almost perfect conversion - what''s not to like?</td>', 'Wonderful detail,almost perfect conversion - what''s not to like?', '2016-09-21 11:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474950, 1187235, 101256, '<td valign="top">Brilliant color, just under being overdone - richly detailed - very nice capture.</td>', 'Brilliant color, just under being overdone - richly detailed - very nice capture.', '2016-09-21 11:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474951, 1187375, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little better crop would have improved this a lot, but it still is a very good motion capture with the reflection.</td>', 'A little better crop would have improved this a lot, but it still is a very good motion capture with the reflection.', '2016-09-21 11:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474952, 1186992, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors in this - not sure I recognize the camo pattern - maybe German? Anyway, interesting capture for sure.</td>', 'Interesting colors in this - not sure I recognize the camo pattern - maybe German? Anyway, interesting capture for sure.', '2016-09-21 11:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474954, 1187598, 101256, '<td valign="top">One of the most dangerous jobs you can do working in trenches. Great color, very good detail - an excellent exhibition of working in difficult circumstances.</td>', 'One of the most dangerous jobs you can do working in trenches. Great color, very good detail - an excellent exhibition of working in difficult circumstances.', '2016-09-21 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474955, 1187099, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is an incredible amount of detail and depth to this image - quite startling in fact.</td>', 'There is an incredible amount of detail and depth to this image - quite startling in fact.', '2016-09-21 11:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474956, 1187082, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very different image from others in the challenge - like the size and overall composition - a good crop from a larger image I suspect. Very nice - good candid capture.</td>', 'Very different image from others in the challenge - like the size and overall composition - a good crop from a larger image I suspect. Very nice - good candid capture.', '2016-09-21 11:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474957, 1187359, 101256, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to get it- very clever. Perhaps a little too subtle and it could have used some more color, but still....well done.</td>', 'Took me a minute to get it- very clever. Perhaps a little too subtle and it could have used some more color, but still....well done.', '2016-09-21 11:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474959, 1187654, 101256, '<td valign="top">Ever notice how men''s shorts are longer than women''s shorts? Just an observation - like the capture - great light and shadow play - well done.</td>', 'Ever notice how men''s shorts are longer than women''s shorts? Just an observation - like the capture - great light and shadow play - well done.', '2016-09-21 11:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474960, 1187604, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting - tough job including the obvious dust in the air. Good candid of a difficult job</td>', 'Interesting - tough job including the obvious dust in the air. Good candid of a difficult job', '2016-09-21 11:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474961, 1187504, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting imagery here - lots of white but not terribly over done.</td>', 'Interesting imagery here - lots of white but not terribly over done.', '2016-09-21 11:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474962, 1187619, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good color and depth control - interesting subject. Nice capture.</td>', 'Good color and depth control - interesting subject. Nice capture.', '2016-09-21 11:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475054, 1187359, 100831, '<td valign="top">an enjoyable view</td>', 'an enjoyable view', '2016-09-21 21:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475055, 1187585, 100831, '<td valign="top">timeless.. great view.</td>', 'timeless.. great view.', '2016-09-21 21:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475056, 1187643, 100831, '<td valign="top">I can relate. Well shown.</td>', 'I can relate. Well shown.', '2016-09-21 21:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475057, 1187548, 100831, '<td valign="top">Ha! Great find. I like it.</td>', 'Ha! Great find. I like it.', '2016-09-21 21:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475058, 1187285, 100831, '<td valign="top">Interesting.. the cows don''t seem bothered. At least I hope not.</td>', 'Interesting.. the cows don''t seem bothered. At least I hope not.', '2016-09-21 21:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475059, 1187650, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the color and intensity.</td>', 'I like the color and intensity.', '2016-09-21 21:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475090, 1187104, 94815, '<td valign="top">Proper sanitation and well focused work.</td>', 'Proper sanitation and well focused work.', '2016-09-21 23:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475093, 1187600, 94815, '<td valign="top">On purely visual terms, I like the zoomy affect that amplifies and focuses on the fish-monger doing his work, but the partial desat is a puzzler. 6</td>', 'On purely visual terms, I like the zoomy affect that amplifies and focuses on the fish-monger doing his work, but the partial desat is a puzzler. 6', '2016-09-21 23:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475094, 1187522, 94815, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured and rendered in old-timey format. bump</td>', 'Beautifully captured and rendered in old-timey format. bump', '2016-09-21 23:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475096, 1187643, 94815, '<td valign="top">Love the boredom scintillatingly captured. bump</td>', 'Love the boredom scintillatingly captured. bump', '2016-09-21 23:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475097, 1187099, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good double P: pov and processing.</td>', 'Good double P: pov and processing.', '2016-09-21 23:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475098, 1187270, 94815, '<td valign="top">Striking to see a grinning construction worker in my experience. You must be pretty.</td>', 'Striking to see a grinning construction worker in my experience. You must be pretty.', '2016-09-21 23:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475099, 1187405, 94815, '<td valign="top">Full of feeling and respect. bump</td>', 'Full of feeling and respect. bump', '2016-09-21 23:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475100, 1187650, 94815, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of extreme concentration.</td>', 'Nice capture of extreme concentration.', '2016-09-21 23:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475106, 1187522, 114285, '<td valign="top">Whoa for you - two ribbons in two days!~<br/> <br/>Loved this shot, and SUPERB EDITING! AND LOOK AT THAT SCORE!! Might take you a while to beat that one :)</td>', 'Whoa for you - two ribbons in two days!~ Loved this shot, and SUPERB EDITING! AND LOOK AT THAT SCORE!! Might take you a while to beat that one :)', '2016-09-22 01:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475107, 1187548, 114285, '<td valign="top">That guy on the left really made this for me, congrats on your ribbon Josh!</td>', 'That guy on the left really made this for me, congrats on your ribbon Josh!', '2016-09-22 01:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475108, 1187600, 114285, '<td valign="top">Well look at you all over the front page, ha, look who''s becoming the ribbon hog -  :-)<br/> <br/>Congrats!</td>', 'Well look at you all over the front page, ha, look who''s becoming the ribbon hog -  :-) Congrats!', '2016-09-22 01:12:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475110, 1187504, 114285, '<td valign="top">Hey, congrats on your HM!</td>', 'Hey, congrats on your HM!', '2016-09-22 01:26:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475116, 1187528, 68504, '<td valign="top">full of feeling.</td>', 'full of feeling.', '2016-09-22 02:32:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475121, 1187522, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Whoa for you - two ribbons in two days!~<br/> <br/>Loved this shot, and SUPERB EDITING! AND LOOK AT THAT SCORE!! Might take you a while to beat that one :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m a happy boy today!<br/> <br/>Funny thing about this shot is that I wasn''t supposed to shoot it!<br/> <br/>I was shooting video for work, then I saw this man doin'' his business and thought it would have been a perfect entry for the challenge, so I switched the camera mode back to photo and quickly composed the shot.<br/> <br/>I had only a few seconds to shoot, as I had to go back in video mode for an the medieval parade - which was approaching the main street.<br/> <br/>So 85mm, 1/80s, f/1.2, handheld... can''t say I was a bit lucky too :)<br/> <br/>Regarding the score... now I have a new goal for 2017 :D<br/> <br/>Thank you SO much for stopping by!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Whoa for you - two ribbons in two days!~ Loved this shot, and SUPERB EDITING! AND LOOK AT THAT SCORE!! Might take you a while to beat that one :)   I''m a happy boy today! Funny thing about this shot is that I wasn''t supposed to shoot it! I was shooting video for work, then I saw this man doin'' his business and thought it would have been a perfect entry for the challenge, so I switched the camera mode back to photo and quickly composed the shot. I had only a few seconds to shoot, as I had to go back in video mode for an the medieval parade - which was approaching the main street. So 85mm, 1/80s, f/1.2, handheld... can''t say I was a bit lucky too :) Regarding the score... now I have a new goal for 2017 :D Thank you SO much for stopping by! ', '2016-09-22 04:25:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475122, 1187600, 172697, '<td valign="top">This is SO dynamic!<br/> <br/>I loved - and feared - this shot.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'This is SO dynamic! I loved - and feared - this shot. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2016-09-22 04:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475131, 1187522, 113278, '<td valign="top">There was never any doubt that this would win, it''s just in a whole other league. Congrats on a very well deserved score and finish.</td>', 'There was never any doubt that this would win, it''s just in a whole other league. Congrats on a very well deserved score and finish.', '2016-09-22 06:22:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475132, 1187548, 135744, '<td valign="top">Nice one! Hope this ribbons stops you selling all your gear:) Congrats!</td>', 'Nice one! Hope this ribbons stops you selling all your gear:) Congrats!', '2016-09-22 06:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475133, 1187522, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MinsoPhoto:</b></div><hr/><i> There was never any doubt that this would win, it''s just in a whole other league. Congrats on a very well deserved score and finish. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Many thanks, Joshua :)</td>', 'Originally posted by MinsoPhoto: There was never any doubt that this would win, it''s just in a whole other league. Congrats on a very well deserved score and finish.   Many thanks, Joshua :)', '2016-09-22 06:24:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475136, 1187522, 135744, '<td valign="top">Superb score and well deserved. The photo is expertly captured and processed and absolutely perfect for the challenge. Congrats!</td>', 'Superb score and well deserved. The photo is expertly captured and processed and absolutely perfect for the challenge. Congrats!', '2016-09-22 06:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475141, 1187600, 135744, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of movement in this photo. Congrats!</td>', 'Love the sense of movement in this photo. Congrats!', '2016-09-22 06:30:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475143, 1187522, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by P-A-U-L:</b></div><hr/><i> Superb score and well deserved. The photo is expertly captured and processed and absolutely perfect for the challenge. Congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much, Paul!<br/>I''m more than glad you liked it.</td>', 'Originally posted by P-A-U-L: Superb score and well deserved. The photo is expertly captured and processed and absolutely perfect for the challenge. Congrats!   Thank you so much, Paul!I''m more than glad you liked it.', '2016-09-22 06:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475149, 1187548, 113278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by P-A-U-L:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice one! Hope this ribbons stops you selling all your gear:) Congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you, unfortunately virtual ribbons, especially only second place ones do not have much monetary value :) I plan on keeping my 50mm and buying a cheap older camera so I can still shoot.</td>', 'Originally posted by P-A-U-L: Nice one! Hope this ribbons stops you selling all your gear:) Congrats!   Thank you, unfortunately virtual ribbons, especially only second place ones do not have much monetary value :) I plan on keeping my 50mm and buying a cheap older camera so I can still shoot.', '2016-09-22 07:22:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475151, 1187643, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>You''re right, the gossip is as much a part of the experience as the hair itself. Your image captures well one of many moments where the mirrored eye contact is engaging both in an important part of the story that takes precedence over the immediate task itself. It is nicely captured in a candid way that feels totally natural and therefore convincing. Your composition is excellent including the foreground tray and soft focus background shows that we are at the hairdressers as opposed to a home setting. The mono processing is good and suits the subject well, the exposure is perfect with good detail throughout and positioned in such a way as to block out the bright light of the window. Another great entry Janine, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge well You''re right, the gossip is as much a part of the experience as the hair itself. Your image captures well one of many moments where the mirrored eye contact is engaging both in an important part of the story that takes precedence over the immediate task itself. It is nicely captured in a candid way that feels totally natural and therefore convincing. Your composition is excellent including the foreground tray and soft focus background shows that we are at the hairdressers as opposed to a home setting. The mono processing is good and suits the subject well, the exposure is perfect with good detail throughout and positioned in such a way as to block out the bright light of the window. Another great entry Janine, well done.', '2016-09-22 07:57:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475153, 1187504, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes to the challenge well<br/> <br/>A skilled image of a skilled lady concentrating on the task in hand, your candid shot has captured the moment well. The exposure is good with plenty of detail throughout and the composition is also good with a clear focal point of whats going on taken in such a position that we get to see the essential elements of her working environment. I suppose the only minor improvement I would make is to angle the camera slightly lower to include less of the ceiling and more of the lower half but it still works ok. Well done for your high score and placing Jonathon.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes to the challenge well A skilled image of a skilled lady concentrating on the task in hand, your candid shot has captured the moment well. The exposure is good with plenty of detail throughout and the composition is also good with a clear focal point of whats going on taken in such a position that we get to see the essential elements of her working environment. I suppose the only minor improvement I would make is to angle the camera slightly lower to include less of the ceiling and more of the lower half but it still works ok. Well done for your high score and placing Jonathon.', '2016-09-22 08:17:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475155, 1187137, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes to the challenge well<br/> <br/>Ah what a great profession to have, working to give others pleasure. You have captured the moment nicely Marcel, you can almost hear the melody playing, his concentration clearly evident with his fingers demonstrating the mastery of his technique. The detail in the musician is very good and well isolated with the soft focus background but that is where I have my main problem. I rather wish I could see more detail in the band behind or a different viewpoint that has less distractions. I know this is not easy especially in a crowded audience so I think a larger DOF would have been better in this instance.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes to the challenge well Ah what a great profession to have, working to give others pleasure. You have captured the moment nicely Marcel, you can almost hear the melody playing, his concentration clearly evident with his fingers demonstrating the mastery of his technique. The detail in the musician is very good and well isolated with the soft focus background but that is where I have my main problem. I rather wish I could see more detail in the band behind or a different viewpoint that has less distractions. I know this is not easy especially in a crowded audience so I think a larger DOF would have been better in this instance.', '2016-09-22 08:32:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475156, 1187099, 100831, '<td valign="top">What a fun image! Congrats on the top ten!</td>', 'What a fun image! Congrats on the top ten!', '2016-09-22 08:33:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475157, 1187616, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes to the challenge well<br/> <br/>How appropriate having last weekend run a birds of prey photography workshop! Truly fits the challenge brief well in an, as you say, slightly different composition, you might try selling him the image for marketing? As opposed to a static wings folded portrait on the glove your bird is more dynamic having some wing movement. He''s nicely isolated from the soft focus background with good sharp detail especially around the all-important eyes and beak. All in all a competent image, well done Eugene.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes to the challenge well How appropriate having last weekend run a birds of prey photography workshop! Truly fits the challenge brief well in an, as you say, slightly different composition, you might try selling him the image for marketing? As opposed to a static wings folded portrait on the glove your bird is more dynamic having some wing movement. He''s nicely isolated from the soft focus background with good sharp detail especially around the all-important eyes and beak. All in all a competent image, well done Eugene.', '2016-09-22 08:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
