(7482256, 1187629, 98565, '<td valign="top">I remember that I already wanted to make a comment during voting but somehow I must have missed it...<br/>Considering the circumstances you did a great job!<br/>If it wasn''t for your title, I would have wondered what on earth they were doing - a picture where you can spent some time exploring all the details, the child in the backbround, the vegetation, the clothing, the fruit skin on the ground, the young man''s hairdo, even the chief''s bare feet are interesting. Thank you for showing all this to us!<br/></td>', 'I remember that I already wanted to make a comment during voting but somehow I must have missed it...Considering the circumstances you did a great job!If it wasn''t for your title, I would have wondered what on earth they were doing - a picture where you can spent some time exploring all the details, the child in the backbround, the vegetation, the clothing, the fruit skin on the ground, the young man''s hairdo, even the chief''s bare feet are interesting. Thank you for showing all this to us!', '2016-11-13 08:08:37.000000', NULL, 0),
